---
// Re-creation of a REAL daily progress report sent to a client (original kept by the owner).
// Figures are copied exactly from the real report. Client, project name and author are hidden on purpose.
// Don't invent or "improve" any figures here.
---
<figure class="dpr-wrap">
  <div class="dpr" aria-label="Sample daily progress report">
    <div class="dpr-head">
      <img src="/emblem.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" />
      <div class="dpr-title">
        <b>DAILY PROGRESS REPORT</b>
        <span class="blur">████████ ██████</span>
      </div>
      <div class="dpr-no"><small>DPR NO.</small><b>09</b><small>Tuesday</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpr-meta">
      <div><small>CLIENT</small><span class="blur">██████ ██████████</span></div>
      <div><small>PROJECT</small>Chemical plant, Gujarat</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpr-stats">
      <div><b>200</b><small>WORKERS</small></div>
      <div><b>50</b><small>SKILLED</small></div>
      <div><b>150</b><small>UNSKILLED</small></div>
      <div><b>2</b><small>WORK ITEMS</small></div>
    </div>
    <p class="dpr-h">Measurement: work executed</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Qty</th><th>Unit</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Earthwork in all soil types, excavation up to 1.5 m depth</td><td>12</td><td>m³</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Excavation from 6.0 m to 7.0 m (warehouse)</td><td>2,268</td><td>m³</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="dpr-h">Equipment deployed</p>
    <table>
      <tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>AJAX 4300</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>JCB</td></tr></tbody>
    </table>
    <div class="dpr-sign"><span>Site Engineer</span><span>Project Manager</span><span>Client Rep.</span></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>A real daily progress report from a chemical plant project in Gujarat. Client details hidden.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dpr-wrap { margin: 0; }
  .dpr { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 22px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(11,58,102,.16); transform: rotate(-1.2deg); }
  .dpr-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .dpr-title { flex: 1; display: grid; }
  .dpr-title b { font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: .3px; }
  .dpr-no { display: grid; text-align: right; line-height: 1.2; }
  .dpr-no b { font-size: 18px; }
  .dpr small { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .6px; }
  .blur { filter: blur(3px); user-select: none; }
  .dpr-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; }
  .dpr-meta div { display: grid; }
  .dpr-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin: 6px 0 12px; }
  .dpr-stats div { border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; padding: 6px 4px; display: grid; }
  .dpr-stats b { font-size: 20px; }
  .dpr-h { font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0 6px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); display: inline-block; }
  .dpr table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .dpr td, .dpr th { border: 1px solid var(--ink); padding: 5px 7px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .dpr td:nth-child(2) { font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .dpr-sign { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .dpr-sign span { border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 4px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; }
  figcaption { font-size: 13px; text-align: center; margin-top: 16px; font-style: italic; }
  @media (max-width: 500px) { .dpr { transform: none; padding: 14px; } .dpr-stats b { font-size: 16px; } }
</style>
